    "body": "Found the patch-loading fault. FFNx adds ff8/en to its configured Hext base directory, but Lexeditor installed the patch in the base itself. Lexeditor now installs the patch in C:\\FF8Mod\\hext\\ff8\\en and rejects the former layout.\n\nThe next check is one FF8 launch from Lexeditor. FFNx.log must show that exact patch file as applied. I did not launch the game.",
